{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.fuyuko.second",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "她第一次拍摄，笑得很标准",
  "status": "review",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.fuyuko.second",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.fuyuko.second",
    "idolId": "fuyuko",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "哇，每张照片都好棒……简直不像ふゆ！",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "staff 先生，谢谢您♪",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "诶嘿嘿，没有那种事啦。",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（嗯，冬優子在现场很受 staff 喜欢啊。）",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（之前也被夸\"可爱的好孩子\"\"总是笑眯眯的\"……）",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（……不过，她的优点应该不只是这些。）",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "──你真的觉得，ふゆ能当偶像吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（冬優子最大的魅力是……）",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "制作人先生……？",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，嗯，我在想点事。冬優子，招呼都打完了？",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "真是的，不是说了要叫\"ふゆ\"吗。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "不过，工作上的支持总是谢谢您♡",
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "你的笑容很讨人喜欢。",
            "nextNodeId": "100"
          },
          {
            "label": "刚才那句\"不像ふゆ\"是什么意思？",
            "nextNodeId": "110"
          },
          {
            "label": "接下来还有工作，先休息。",
            "nextNodeId": "120"
          }
        ]
      },
      "100": {
        "id": "100",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "诶嘿嘿，那是ふゆ的卖点嘛♡",
        "nextNodeId": "101"
      },
      "101": {
        "id": "101",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（笑得很好看。不过……）",
        "nextNodeId": "102"
      },
      "102": {
        "id": "102",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "……怎么了，那种表情。"
      },
      "110": {
        "id": "110",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "啊……那个啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "111"
      },
      "111": {
        "id": "111",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "照片里的ふゆ，太完美了嘛。",
        "nextNodeId": "112"
      },
      "112": {
        "id": "112",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "太完美的东西，看起来就不像真的，不是吗？"
      },
      "120": {
        "id": "120",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "好——那就休息一下吧。",
        "nextNodeId": "121"
      },
      "121": {
        "id": "121",
        "speakerId": "fuyuko",
        "text": "……あんた，还挺会看时机的嘛。",
        "nextNodeId": "122"
      },
      "122": {
        "id": "122",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（刚才那句，语气完全不一样了。）"
      }
    }
  },
